# Package sources live in plain git here (the whole package is about 2.4 MB). A package with
# large binaries may keep them in Git LFS instead: uncomment the patterns it needs. Releases
# never depend on it: installers fetch the release asset, never the repository (RFC-0015).
# *.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.ktx2 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.glb binary
*.png binary
